# Response headers for the public site's static assets on Cloudflare (docs/design/0019, wrangler.jsonc). Ignored by
# `pnpm dev`.
#
# Cross-origin isolation (COOP/COEP) enables SharedArrayBuffer, so ONNX Runtime can run multithreaded
# (inference/runtime.ts checks `crossOriginIsolated`). Everything the page loads from elsewhere must then allow it:
# the data host (redqueen-data.mackinations.ca) sends CORS headers.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Vite's output is content-hashed: a changed file is a new name, so these never need revalidating.
/_nuxt/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
